Supabase RLS Note
The admin dashboard uses authenticated Supabase sessions.
Your supabase_setup.sql from the application form repo already includes:
CREATE POLICY "Authenticated read"
  ON applications FOR SELECT TO authenticated USING (true);
Make sure this policy is in place. Authenticated users can also UPDATE and DELETE — add those policies if needed:
CREATE POLICY "Authenticated update"
  ON applications FOR UPDATE TO authenticated USING (true);

CREATE POLICY "Authenticated delete"
  ON applications FOR DELETE TO authenticated USING (true);
Run these in your Supabase SQL Editor.
